# TPOL r1: the song home's K1-K4 strip edits the cursor clip's settings (length, mode, launch,
# swing), so the song home has no motion lane. HOME + a knob there must leave the value alone and
# mark HOME used, and the STUDIO cheat sheet must not list "K1-K4 touch: clear knob lane" on a
# screen that has no lane. (The row stays on the sound pages and the clip MOTION page.)
wait 300
expect clipused0 1
expect cliplen0 16
press HOME
wait 600
expect sheet 1
spin K1 20
wait 100
expect cliplen0 16
expect msg 1                    # "NO LANES HERE": the gesture answers instead of editing
shot studio_home_knob_sheet.png
release HOME
wait 100
expect cliplen0 16
dump studio_home_knob.json
